I have played over 150 hours and this aree my thoughts about the game.

if you are a warhammer fan you should play the game even though is  bad:

- same  interface for every faction;
- A.I is really bad and you can get any faction to be you ally just by giving them a couple of  cities;
- ability threes of the champions are all the same with small differences;
- end game is super borign;
- siegies are terrible;

My review would not be bad if the came cost 60€ and you get to play for 200 hours. The problem is that if you release 30 dlc and you do not fix the problems of the game, I feel scammed. I would have expected  more from company that has been developing this kind of games for 20 years and it has worked over 10  years on the Warhammer saga.

